sequenceDiagram
    participant Client (React)
    participant Server (Express)
    participant Database (MongoDB)

    Client->>Server: POST /api/auth/login (email, password)
    Server->>Database: Find user by email
    Database-->>Server: Return User Document
    Server->>Server: Validate Password (bcrypt.compare)
    Server->>Server: Generate JWT Token
    Server-->>Client: 200 OK (Token + User Object)
    Client->>Client: Store Token (Local Storage / State)
    Client->>Server: GET /api/user/profile (Auth Header)
    Server-->>Client: 200 OK (Protected Data)